    {
      "@id": "concept:competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sec-56gf-ss-1",
      "@type": "cml:Concept",
      "dc:source": "competition-and-consumer-act-2010.pdf, p.163",
      "skos:note": "A person is subject to the CDR provisions if they act or omit to act in a way that affects a corporation's activities.",
      "skos:prefLabel": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "56GF(1) Application of the CDR provisions"
      },
      "wasDerivedFrom": "competition-and-consumer-act-2010.pdf",
      "asserts": [
        "concept:competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sec-56gf-ss-1-norm",
        "concept:competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sec-56gf-ss-1-logic-deontic-1"
      ],
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:integrityHash": "0f3a3566407a68f50c07d6a7962a4f8df10dda55bd46ba55d69f31d46ed33a67",
      "cml:proposedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml"
      },
      "realizedBy": "doc:competition-and-consumer-act-2010#sec-56gf-ss-1",
      "cml:schemaVersion": "2",
      "partOf": "concept:competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sec-56gf"
    },
    {
      "@id": "concept:competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sec-56gf-ss-1-logic-deontic-1",
      "@type": "cml:LogicApplication",
      "cml:conclusionText": "(1) The CDR provisions apply to a person if:  (a) the person is a corporation; or  (b) the person is not a corporation, but the person:  (i) acts; or  (ii) omits to act;  in a way that affects, is capable of affecting or is taken with intent to affect the activities, functions, relationships or business of a corporation.",
      "cml:confidence": {
        "@type": "xsd:decimal",
        "@value": "1.0000"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:executionSurface": "modalities::logic::deontic",
      "cml:logicSummary": "Obligation to act or omit to act in a way that affects a corporation's activities.",
      "cml:modality": {
        "@id": "cml:Deontic"
      },
      "cml:operator": "Obligation",
      "cml:premiseText": "(1) The CDR provisions apply to a person if:  (a) the person is a corporation; or  (b) the person is not a corporation, but the person:  (i) acts; or  (ii) omits to act;  in a way that affects, is capable of affecting or is taken with intent to affect the activities, functions, relationships or business of a corporation."
    },
