    {
      "@id": "concept:competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sec-95n-ss-3-logic-alleninterval-2",
      "@type": "cml:LogicApplication",
      "cml:conclusionText": "The supplying of goods or services before the applicable day is during the committing of an offence.",
      "cml:confidence": {
        "@type": "xsd:decimal",
        "@value": "1.0000"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:executionSurface": "modalities::interval_reasoning",
      "cml:logicSummary": "Describes the temporal relation between supplying goods or services before the applicable day and committing an offence.",
      "cml:modality": {
        "@id": "cml:AllenInterval"
      },
      "cml:operator": "during",
      "cml:premiseText": "(3) The person commits an offence if:  (a) before the applicable day in relation to the business notice, the person supplies (the current supply) goods or services of that description in a locality on particular terms and conditions; and"
    },
    {
      "@id": "concept:competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sec-95n-ss-3-logic-cogai-5",
      "@type": "cml:LogicApplication",
      "cml:conclusionText": "The supplying of goods or services of that description in that locality on particular terms and conditions is part of having a business notice.",
      "cml:confidence": {
        "@type": "xsd:decimal",
        "@value": "1.0000"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:executionSurface": "sparql_library::parsers::chk_parser",
      "cml:logicSummary": "Describes the relation between supplying goods or services of a particular description in a locality on particular terms and conditions and having a business notice.",
      "cml:modality": {
        "@id": "cml:CogAI"
      },
      "cml:operator": "hasPart",
      "cml:premiseText": "(3) The person commits an offence if:  (a) before the applicable day in relation to the business notice, the person supplies (the current supply) goods or services of that description in a locality on particular terms and conditions; and"
    },
    {
      "@id": "concept:competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sec-95n-ss-3-logic-deontic-1",
      "@type": "cml:LogicApplication",
      "cml:conclusionText": "The person must not supply goods or services on particular terms and conditions before the applicable day.",
      "cml:confidence": {
        "@type": "xsd:decimal",
        "@value": "1.0000"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:executionSurface": "modalities::logic::deontic",
      "cml:logicSummary": "Prohibits supplying goods or services on particular terms and conditions before the applicable day.",
      "cml:modality": {
        "@id": "cml:Deontic"
      },
      "cml:operator": "forbid",
      "cml:premiseText": "(3) The person commits an offence if:  (a) before the applicable day in relation to the business notice, the person supplies (the current supply) goods or services of that description in a locality on particular terms and conditions; and"
    },
    {
      "@id": "concept:competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sec-95n-ss-3-logic-diffusion-4",
      "@type": "cml:LogicApplication",
      "cml:conclusionText": "The supplying of goods or services before the applicable day is if the person commits an offence.",
      "cml:confidence": {
        "@type": "xsd:decimal",
        "@value": "1.0000"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:executionSurface": "modalities::diffusion",
      "cml:logicSummary": "Describes the condition under which supplying goods or services before the applicable day leads to committing an offence.",
      "cml:modality": {
        "@id": "cml:Diffusion"
      },
      "cml:operator": "if",
      "cml:premiseText": "(3) The person commits an offence if:  (a) before the applicable day in relation to the business notice, the person supplies (the current supply) goods or services of that description in a locality on particular terms and conditions; and"
    },
    {
      "@id": "concept:competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sec-95n-ss-3-logic-ltl-3",
      "@type": "cml:LogicApplication",
      "cml:conclusionText": "The supplying of goods or services on particular terms and conditions after the applicable day is until the committing of an offence.",
      "cml:confidence": {
        "@type": "xsd:decimal",
        "@value": "1.0000"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:executionSurface": "modalities::temporal_ltl",
      "cml:logicSummary": "Describes the temporal relation between supplying goods or services on particular terms and conditions after the applicable day and committing an offence.",
      "cml:modality": {
        "@id": "cml:LTL"
      },
      "cml:operator": "until",
      "cml:premiseText": "(3) The person commits an offence if:  (a) before the applicable day in relation to the business notice, the person supplies (the current supply) goods or services of that description in a locality on particular terms and conditions; and"
    },
